                  "type": "textComponent",
                  "text": "Full-stack Developer and Project lead for Yelp Reservations. Built new features in software for managing restaurants and facilitating diners' ability to make reservations through Yelp, in React (web frontend) and Python (django, celery, redis, postgres, SQS, elasticsearch) on the backend.\n\nAs a project lead:\n• Scoped and implemented backend instrumentation for experiments driving app downloads via deep deferred links to a native, improved reservation management experience in iOS & Android\n\n• Streamlined new account provisioning and subscription management for Yelp Reservations via integrations with Zuora and SFDC, in collaboration with engineers across multiple departments\n\n• Planning and full-stack implementation of mobile and desktop web flows for accepting credit card holds during reservation checkout\n\n• Maintain and provide on-going support for highly available system, ensuring ease of observability and visibility into system health via automated alerting and dashboards in Splunk and SignalFX."
